# Ontology of the ML-papers pack: the CS-KG 2.0 seed (https://scholkg.kmi.open.ac.uk/cskg/ontology), hand-written
# from the CS-KG specification (no download); see provenance.json. pack.yaml maps the roles onto it (one class per
# role: the context role takes cskg:Material; cskg:Task is in the seed for the task type).
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .
@prefix cskg: <https://w3id.org/cskg/ontology#> .

cskg:Method a owl:Class .
cskg:Metric a owl:Class .
cskg:Material a owl:Class .
cskg:Task a owl:Class .
cskg:OtherEntity a owl:Class .
cskg:based-on a owl:ObjectProperty .
